{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "No driver to have under-18s in their car for 3 years after their driving test",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "The Government should produce a law ensuring that drivers should not be able to have anyone under the age of 18 in their car for the first 3 years after passing their driving test.  This period should be increased if in that time the driver has points on their license.",
